@abhi-kumar Like many other publically availaible datasets, the annotations in this dataset along with all the code in this repo is licensed under [Apache License 2.0](https://github.com/Rishit-dagli/CPPE-Dataset/blob/main/LICENSE) for myself and @ialimustufa , please feel free to cite our paper. We do not own the copyright of the images. Use of the images must abide by the [Flickr Terms of Use](https://www.flickr.com/creativecommons/).

I believe you can most certainly use this dataset for a course/book, off the top of my head an example I recall is the [Deep learning for Computer Vision book](https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/deep-learning-for/9781788295628/) which uses the COCO dataset which is released under the same terms.

Thanks so much for your interest!
